# Reference checksums for the PBMC3k clustering arm (arm G).
#
# These are the outputs of the one arm of the paper that reproduces today.
# The files themselves are gitignored (reproducibility/clustering/.gitignore)
# and exist in exactly one working tree; this manifest is the only record of
# their bytes that is in version control. It is deliberately committed BEFORE
# the Zenodo deposit, so the deposit can be verified against it.
#
# Produced: 2026-06-11 (h5ad 10:04-10:18, metrics 11:21, figures 11:23-11:24),
#           by the code at c7c5d94 "Extend clustering DE experiment: raw 10x
#           input, Wilcoxon, recall/best-match, all-sig signatures".
#           Inferred from mtimes and content, not from a recorded run log.
#
# Paths are relative to the arm's output root, so they survive the
# reproducibility/ flattening. To verify:
#
#     cd reproducibility/clustering/output          # after flattening: reproducibility/output
#     shasum -a 256 -c ../../reference/clustering/checksums.sha256
#
# Scope: 22 figures, 68 metrics CSVs, 2 DE-annotated h5ads (92 files).
# clustering_results.zip is deliberately excluded: zip archives embed mtimes,
# so its hash is not reproducible from a rerun and would be a false negative.
